B.XP=new A.fs("O My servants who believe \u2014 indeed, My earth is spacious, and My mercy encompasses all things.","Quran 29:56 \xb7 7:156 \u2014 excerpts")
B.XS=new A.fs("The dua of Yunus from inside the whale: La ilaha illa anta, subhanaka, inni kuntu minaz-zalimin \u2014 and Allah answered him. He answers you too.","Quran 21:87\u201388")
B.XM=new A.fs("Ya\u2019qub \u0639\u0644\u064a\u0647 \u0627\u0644\u0633\u0644\u0627\u0645 lost his sight from grief and said only: I complain of my sorrow and grief to Allah.","Quran 12:86 \u2014 excerpt")
